<figure id="algorithm2" class="ltx_float ltx_algorithm ltx_framed ltx_framed_top">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_float"><span id="algorithm2.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Algorithm 2</span> </span>Sampling with GenPT</figcaption>
<div id="algorithm2.4" class="ltx_listing ltx_lst_numbers_left ltx_framed ltx_framed_topbottom ltx_listing">
<div id="algorithm2.4.1" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="algorithm2.4.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Input :</span> Transformer <math id="algorithm2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{T}_{\theta}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒯</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{T}_{\theta}</annotation></semantics></math>, encoder <math id="algorithm2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{F}_{\phi}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℱ</mi><mi>ϕ</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{F}_{\phi}</annotation></semantics></math>, MLP <math id="algorithm2.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{M}_{\rho}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi><mi>ρ</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{M}_{\rho}</annotation></semantics></math>, tuple <math id="algorithm2.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\{I,P^{q}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>P</mi><mi>q</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\{I,P^{q}\}</annotation></semantics></math>.
</div>
<div id="algorithm2.4.2" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="algorithm2.4.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Output :</span> Samples <math id="algorithm2.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\{\tilde{P},\tilde{V},\tilde{C}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>P</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>V</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>C</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\{\tilde{P},\tilde{V},\tilde{C}\}</annotation></semantics></math>.
</div>
<div id="algorithm2.4.3" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="algorithm2.4.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Note :</span> Assume tensor broadcasting when no explicit repeats are performed. <math id="algorithm2.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\texttt{cat}(\{\cdot,\ldots\},n)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_monospace">cat</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><mo>,</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\texttt{cat}(\{\cdot,\ldots\},n)</annotation></semantics></math> concatenates a tuple of tensors along the <math id="algorithm2.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n^{\text{th}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>n</mi><mtext>th</mtext></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n^{\text{th}}</annotation></semantics></math> axis. <span id="algorithm2.4.3.2" class="ltx_text ltx_markedasmath ltx_font_typewriter">slice(I, T, n)</span> slices tensor <math id="algorithm2.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="I" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>I</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">I</annotation></semantics></math> into <math id="algorithm2.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N_{T}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>T</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N_{T}</annotation></semantics></math> overlapping windows of size <math id="algorithm2.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>T</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T</annotation></semantics></math> along its <math id="algorithm2.m12" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n^{\text{th}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>n</mi><mtext>th</mtext></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n^{\text{th}}</annotation></semantics></math> axis.
</div>
<div id="algorithm2.4.4" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algorithm2.4.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">1</span></span>
