<div id="algorithm2.4.49" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span>  <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span>  <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> <span id="algorithm2.4.49.1" class="ltx_text"><span id="algorithm2.4.49.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#34A853;">// </span> </span><span id="algorithm2.4.49.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#34A853;">Refine ground truth estimate. </span> 
